  <library>
    <event name="Rough Cut — right-index-options">
      <project name="right-index-options">
        <sequence format="r1" duration="2677/30s" tcStart="0s" tcFormat="NDF" audioLayout="stereo" audioRate="44.1k">
          <spine>
            <asset-clip ref="r2" offset="0s" name="hook_intro_engineers" start="93/10s" duration="102/5s">
              <note>Covers the opening hook describing the three engineers and the question about who did best; the latest complete take is from 00:00:09.30 to 00:00:29.69, while the earlier attempt starting at 00:00:01.11 is incomplete because it contains a low-confidence word and then restarts into the same hook.</note>
            </asset-clip>
            <asset-clip ref="r2" offset="102/5s" name="hook_cora_take1" start="297/10s" duration="67/5s">
              <note>Covers Cora's first description up through checking search quality through recall; selected take 1 because later repeats of the same lines include a [TRIGGER:"rephrase"] and low-confidence words, so they are incomplete.</note>
            </asset-clip>
            <asset-clip ref="r2" offset="169/5s" name="hook_cora_take2_samantha_intro" start="1501/30s" duration="257/30s">
              <note>Covers the clean completion of Cora's description and the transition into Samantha's setup; selected the later complete take starting at 00:00:50.04, rejecting the earlier repeated Cora take because it was interrupted by a restart trigger.</note>
            </asset-clip>
            <asset-clip ref="r2" offset="1271/30s" name="hook_samantha_setup" start="898/15s" duration="143/15s">
              <note>Covers Samantha's vector model, Matryoshka truncation, and BBQ quantization; selected the last complete rendition in this segment, while the attempt ending at 00:01:09.39 is incomplete because it trails off with low-confidence restarted words.</note>
            </asset-clip>
            <asset-clip ref="r2" offset="519/10s" name="hook_ben_setup" start="743/10s" duration="202/15s">
              <note>Covers Ben's self-hosted model, disk-heavy storage, aggressive quantization, and tiny reranker; selected the only complete take, with the earlier words before the silence gap rejected because they are broken and incomplete.</note>
            </asset-clip>
            <asset-clip ref="r2" offset="1961/30s" name="hook_close_and_transition" start="2633/30s" duration="419/30s">
              <note>Covers Ben's tiny bill and the closing question leading into the framework section; selected the full clean take from 00:01:27.77 to 00:01:42.28/00:01:42.38 range, while later repeats are rejected because they begin mid-sentence and contain restart triggers.</note>
            </asset-clip>
            <asset-clip ref="r2" offset="238/3s" name="framework_intro" start="3071/30s" duration="113/30s">
              <note>Covers the clean complete reread of 'Should they all be happy with these vastly different outcomes?' selected as take 2, because the earlier version contains a restart trigger and the immediate follow-up in the transcript is incomplete.</note>
            </asset-clip>
            <asset-clip ref="r2" offset="831/10s" name="framework_transition" start="1592/15s" duration="92/15s">
              <note>Covers 'What do you think? Let's learn more about these decisions.'; selected the last complete take before the section break, while later repeated fragments are rejected due to restart triggers and low-confidence words.</note>
            </asset-clip>
          </spine>
        </sequence>
      </project>
    </event>
